(first excess property only). The signature match is exact. CI IS resolving ajv 6.15.0 — the nested eslint copy must be hoisted to root on CI.

Why would CI's npm ci hoist eslint's ajv 6.15.0 to root while MY node_modules has ajv 8.20.0 at root? Because `npm ci` reifies the lockfile... both point to the same lockfile...

